---
# Each inline line's speaker is cast further down its panel, or by the panel it is over.
cast: {ALICE: {reference: alice}}
---
PAGE ONE

PANEL 1
BOB: First.
@cast: {BOB: {reference: bob}}

PANEL 2
@over: 1
BOB: Still me.

PAGE TWO

PANEL 1
CAROL: Hello.
@cast: {CAROL: {reference: alice}}

PANEL 2
@over: 1
CAROL: Again.
